    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d735-a1">

                <pb facs="1265" n="1251" sameAs="frus:frus1950v06/pg1251"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Attachment]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for General Magruder</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1950-07-21">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">July</hi> 21, 1950</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">japanese police establishment</hi>
                </p>
                <p>I am enclosing for your information and for whatever action you deem appropriate
                    a memorandum summarizing the background and views of the Department of State on
                    the question of strengthening the Japanese police establishment. With reference
                    to the final paragraph entitled “Recommended Action”, it is believed that what
                    is needed in Washington is a full account of the measures SCAP has taken, is taking, or proposes to take to
                    strengthen the Japanese police. It is possible that an up-to-date report of
                        SCAP’s plans in the premises would dispose
                    of a good deal of the concern felt here about the ability of the Japanese police
                    to cope with organized, large-scale subversion and disorders.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">John</hi> M. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Allison</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Director</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Office of Northeastern Asian Affairs</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
